  "description": "Main CI #155 (run 44962301903, commit 3637e36) failed only on [webkit] e2e/rapid-pace.spec.ts:248 'the paused-clock pace check catches a 400 ms wait': meterBotAction returned null ('a bot is to act'), i.e. no bot was left to act before the user's turn. Branch CI for the same code (#154) and main #153 passed, so it's timing-dependent: the start-up loop advances the paused clock in 50 ms slices for up to 2,000 ms with every 0 ms wait stretched to 400 ms, so several bot actions (each awaiting a worker reply) can complete during start-up and use up the bots before the user's seat. Test-only flake from TASK-3.13 (locked file; owner TASK-3.13).",
